    "rowAccent": { "x": 0, "y": 6130, "text": "Accent study — brass is the row above", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1880 },
    "accentNote": { "x": 1960, "y": 6380, "w": 380, "text": "DECIDED 2026-10-19 (founder): brass stays. Kept for the record. Same screens, only the accent changes. Brass (above) reads gold-on-black: loud on glass. Verdigris (recommended) is the other colour already in Omen's brand spec: aged copper green, calm, unlike any sportsbook, and it holds contrast in dark and light. Bone drops colour almost entirely: quiet and expensive, but status and action lean on weight alone. Pick one; it then applies to every frame and the light mode." },
    "rowLight": { "x": 0, "y": 4790, "text": "Light mode — proposal", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 1600 },
    "lightNote": { "x": 940, "y": 5040, "w": 360, "text": "Light mode, not beige: a neutral near-white ground, white cards, near-black text. Brass is darker in light (#9A6A16) so links and labels pass contrast on white; primary buttons carry white text. Same layout, same tokens by role: one switch in Account (Dark / Light / Match iPhone). Team colours come later as a theme pack." }
